ADDITIONAL TERMS – WATERMARK AND ANTI-PLAGIARISM PROTECTION

1. Protection:
   This project includes console warnings and invisible marks inside games to
   protect against plagiarism. These are part of the integrity protection.

2. No Removal:
   You may not remove, obscure, or alter any watermark or attribution that
   protects the original authorship.

3. Anti-Plagiarism:
   Copying code, assets, or game logic without permission violates:
   - Terms: https://pineappleva.github.io/Games/legal/terminos/
   - DMCA: https://pineappleva.github.io/Games/legal/dmca/
   - This LICENSE
   If you want to reuse any part, contact pineapplevacorp@gmail.com first.

4. Security:
   Console prints a Self-XSS warning. Do not paste code you do not understand.
   For reports: pineapplevacorp@gmail.com
   Official X: https://x.com/pineapplevacorp
